    "long_instructions": "# Plant Doctor: train the model\nPlant Doctor needs to decide if a plant is **Healthy** or **Sick**. This data set describes 54 houseplants by what you can see.\n\n1. Look at each column. Which ones do you think tell healthy and sick plants apart?\n2. Add **Leaf Spots**, **Leaf Color**, **Drooping** and **Soil Moisture** as features.\n3. Train the model and look at the results. Which plants did it get wrong?\n4. Save the model. Name it **Plant Doctor**. You will use it in your app.",
